                    "errorCode": "API-CPQQUOTES-005",
                    "message": "Unprocessable Entity",
                    "detailedMessage": "Erro de valida\u00e7\u00e3o - O par\u00e2metro obrigat\u00f3rio para opera\u00e7\u00e3o tem valor inv\u00e1lido dos dicion\u00e1rios NC (por exemplo, marketId).",
